{"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Writing Rules","anchor":"Writing-Rules","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/WritingRules","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Rule","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Rules","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Intent","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Command","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/say(_:)","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/sayOnceThisTurn(_:)","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/say(_:from:)-9dkx0","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/say(_:from:)-29lpm","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/say(_:from:)-9dafx","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/say(_:from:)-1kn0c","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/Earshot","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/refuse(_:)","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/reply(_:)","doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/require(_:else:)"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/proceed()"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Runs the stage-4 default action (a game\/plugin override if one is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"registered for this intent, else the built-in) immediately, then returns"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so the calling rule can embellish the result — print something more, read"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"state the default action changed, and so on."}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Function","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Gnusto"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"proceed"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}],"externalID":"s:6Gnusto7proceedyyKF","symbolKind":"func","title":"proceed()"},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto"]]},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"proceed","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/WritingRules"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Callable from any stage 1–3 "},{"code":"before","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"-phase rule — "},{"code":"world.before","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"location.beforeEachTurn","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"location.before","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", or "},{"code":"item.before","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", on either"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the indirect or direct object — and only once per turn. "},{"code":"proceed()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" means"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"“run the default now; I take responsibility”: once it runs, the pipeline"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"skips its own stage-4 step (so the default doesn’t run twice) "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"and"}]},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"skips every remaining before rule still ahead of the calling rule in this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"turn’s sequence — including later rules in the same before-phase, not just"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"later phases. A guard written as a later "},{"code":"before","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" rule — whether a sibling"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in the same phase or an "},{"code":"item.before","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" rule on the direct object when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"proceed()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" was called from "},{"code":"world.before","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — never gets to run, so it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can’t refuse an action that has already happened. Calling it from an "},{"code":"after","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"\/each-turn"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rule, or calling it twice, is a programmer error and traps with a clear"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"message rather than silently double-running the default action."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["mailbox.before(.open) {","    try proceed()                    \/\/ built-in open runs here","    say(\"A city map is tucked inside the lid.\")","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the default action throws (e.g. a built-in "},{"code":"open","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" refuses because the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"item is locked), that "},{"code":"TurnInterrupt","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" propagates out of "},{"code":"proceed()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"exactly as it would have out of the pipeline’s own stage 4."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gnusto\/proceed()"]}],"references":{"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/say(_:from:)-9dkx0":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/say(_:from:)-9dkx0","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"say","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"from","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8Loc